#==============================================================================================
#
#   border_radii_data - the engine half of Painting::BorderRadiiData and BordersData:
#   converting radii and border widths to device pixels
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/BorderRadiiData.cpp (lines 13-19:
#       BorderRadiusData::as_corner), BorderRadiiData.h (lines 148-159: as_corners) and
#       BordersData.cpp (lines 1-34: to_device_pixels). The data structs live in the display
#       list (luce-browser-render, region r51a); these members read the DevicePixelConverter
#       and the DisplayListRecordingContext, which are the engine's (DESIGN.md §4.1.3).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2020, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2021-2023, Sam Atkins <atkinssj@serenityos.org>
